<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $46-1/4 (FIM 211.31).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $46-1/4 (FIM 211.31).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $0-3/4 hihger at $46-1/4 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 211.31 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed down 0.30 markka at 210.70.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed $0-1/8 lower at $32-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.96 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.40 markka at 74.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-1/8 at $20-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed up 0.80 at 92.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
